      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Convert input with P and output with Q⁻¹ · 输入乘 P，输出乘 Q⁻¹"
    },
    {
      "id": "e06",
      "fromNode": "general-basis-change",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "similarity",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Same input and output conversion gives similarity · 输入输出采用同一转换，得到相似"
    },
    {
      "id": "e07",
      "fromNode": "matrix-columns",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "composition",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Composition multiplies matrices when the middle basis agrees · 中间基一致时复合对应矩阵相乘"
    },
    {
      "id": "e08",
      "fromNode": "basis-images",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "dependent-images",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Every input relation must be preserved · 每条输入线性关系都须保留"
    },
    {
      "id": "e09",
      "fromNode": "basis-images",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "nonspanning-images",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Independent, non-spanning inputs and W≠{0}: nonunique · 输入无关但不张成且 W≠{0}：延拓不唯一"
    },
    {
      "id": "e10",
      "fromNode": "basis-direction",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "orthonormal-change",
      "toSide": "top",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Two orthonormal bases, one inner product ⇒ P⁻¹=P* · 同一内积下两基标准正交 ⇒ P⁻¹=P*"
    }
  ]
}
